			<div class="content" id="post-content-1928883">
									

<p>Tentacles, man. I actually did it. Thanks to Djoric for aiming me in this direction. A fair amount of this was crafted from feedback given by Randomini, MrCarbon, bluesoul, thedeadlymoose, Anborough, Slate, Pemander, and otherpeoplebutthislistisgettinglong.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;What&nbsp;the&nbsp;tentacles&nbsp;do,&nbsp;since&nbsp;I'm&nbsp;sure&nbsp;somebody&nbsp;is&nbsp;still&nbsp;'Bro&nbsp;tentacles&nbsp;wtf'</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Bro&nbsp;it's&nbsp;like&nbsp;&nbsp;this</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Nose - Breathing apparatus<br />
Mouth - Food<br />
Anus, genitalia - Removal of waste. You don't want to shit in your <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">car</span> shrimp mecha, do you?<br />
Eyes - Vision</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>You know what's fun? This is a GOI skip. Most people haven't gotten it in the first read.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Spoiler&nbsp;for&nbsp;what&nbsp;GOI&nbsp;it&nbsp;is</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;:D</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>SCP-1569 was designed and bred by the folks at the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/it-always-has-been-it-always-has-not-been|">Shark Punching Center</a>! The &quot;fist superimposing a sunburst&quot; is their logo! Also the thing punches other things, and hates sharks. Or at least the operator did. Who knows how this particular shrimp and operator ended up in the SCP reality.</p>
</div>
</div>
